,1069,360],"lines":[{"id":"p002_r21_l001","bbox":[1421,498,986,32],"text":"A lottery is being run by the Salesian Fathers of St. John Bosco","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l002","bbox":[1347,535,1064,32],"text":"in Calcutta for the sake of providing bread and clothing to hundreds","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l003","bbox":[1347,571,1069,32],"text":"of boys to whom they impart a sound technical and social education","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l004","bbox":[1347,605,1060,35],"text":"in their institutions in India. We solicit the co-operation of all good","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l005","bbox":[1347,643,1062,32],"text":"people. It is a work which will no doubt draw God's blessings upon","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l006","bbox":[1347,677,1067,37],"text":"those who so help. Over one lakh of Rupees is distributed in prizes,","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l007","bbox":[1347,715,1065,35],"text":"every time, and in addition a large commission is given to collectors.","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l008","bbox":[1347,751,1065,36],"text":"Each ticket costs Rs. 2/-. (Rupees two only). The drawing date of","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l009","bbox":[1347,790,1067,33],"text":"the event in course is on 20—12—51. All correspondence is to be","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r21_l010","bbox":[1347,826,538,32],"text":"done in English and addressed to:-","src":"sarvam"}]},{"id":"p002_r22","type":"paragraph","production":"printed","bbox":[692,865,573,73],"lines":[{"id":"p002_r22_l001","bbox":[692,865,573,32],"text":"പ്പടക്കേണ്ടതു് അത്യാവശ്യം. അതു് ആ","src":"sarvam"},{"id":"p002_r22_l002","bbox":[692,905,573,33],"text":"വഞ്ചകനു ബോധ്യപ്പെട്ടു. ഈശോയെക്കു","src":"sarvam"}]},{"id":"p002_r23","type":"paragraph","production":"printed","bbox":[1828,888,493,33],"lines":[{"id":"p002_r23_l001","bbox":[1828,888,493,33],"text":"The Honorary Secretary,","src":"sarvam"}]},{"id":"p002_r24","type":"heading","production":"printed","bbox":[692,944,573,32],"lines":[{"id":"p002_r24_l001"